  "details": "In maps with a large number of triggers, VRC_EventHandler begins to take up a noticeable amount of processing. In my current project, I have enough event handlers that disabling all of them drops CPU time from 6.2 ms to 5.2 ms. Using the Unity Profiler, it is all happening in VRC_EventHandler.LateUpdate()",
